# 强制所有文本文件用 LF 行尾, 防止 WSL/Windows 之间编辑导致 CRLF 污染。
# 这与仓库 HEAD 现状一致(全部 LF), 也避免 git diff 出现海量"行尾噪音"。

* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件显式标记, 避免被错误转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.so binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.h5 binary
*.keras binary
*.pkl binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.onnx binary
*.pb binary
*.tflite binary
